        "t": 480.0525,
        "r": 539.0624999999998,
        "b": 439.49625
      },
      "content": "Use  this  section  in  conjunction  with Performance  Verification section  and Spare Parts section.  To  remove  and  replace  a  part  you  suspect  is  defective,  follow  the instructions in Disassembly Guide section.",
