    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0569",
      "reading_order": 619,
      "section": "5.3 Who Should Perform Repairs",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.75,
        "t": 398.25375,
        "r": 539.0622500000003,
        "b": 344.99625
      },
      "content": "Only qualified service personnel should open the monitor housing, remove and replace components,  or  make  adjustments  in  accordance  with  this  service  manual .  If  your medical  facility  does  not  have  qualified  service  personnel,  contact  Nellcor  Technical Services or your local Nellcor representative.",
